/-! Generic resource growth for the corrected grouped numeric envelope.
This transports the established phase accounting to original equal inputs
without reinterpreting them as unequal-source instances. -/
namespace Blotto.GeneralPaperEqualFirstSpaceGrowth
open GeneralPaperUniformResourceGrowth GeneralPaperEqualUniformRateAlgebra
set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxHeartbeats 5000000
set_option maxRecDepth 16384

